MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 Ack_ack
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 3 2 )
END

Ack_ack [ 3 ]
BEGIN
CJUMP NE TEMP 1 0 L2
CJUMP MINUS 1 NE TEMP 1 0 L3
 
L2 
MOVE TEMP 3 PLUS TEMP 2 1

 JUMP L4
L3 CJUMP LE TEMP 1 0 L5
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 0 L8
 L8 CJUMP NE TEMP 2 0 L6
CJUMP MINUS 1 NE TEMP 2 0 L5

 
L5 
MOVE TEMP 3 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 5 0
RETURN TEMP 6
END ( TEMP 4 MINUS TEMP 1 1 1 )

 JUMP L7
L6 CJUMP LE TEMP 1 0 L9
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 1 0 L12
 L12 CJUMP LE TEMP 2 0 L10
CJUMP MINUS 1 LE TEMP 2 0 L9

 
L9 
MOVE TEMP 3 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 0
RETURN TEMP 9
END ( TEMP 7 MINUS TEMP 1 1 CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 11 0
RETURN TEMP 12
END ( TEMP 10 TEMP 1 MINUS TEMP 2 1 ) )

 JUMP L11
L10 
MOVE TEMP 3 0


L11 NOOP

L7 NOOP

L4 NOOP

RETURN TEMP 3
END

